APP Marketplace multi-cloud aws gcp

USE stripe PIN 1.2.3
USE elastic PIN 8.1.0

HAVE Seller with id uuid balance decimal secure
HAVE Listing with id uuid price decimal
HAVE Purchase with buyer uuid seller uuid amount decimal

DO Purchase and idempotent circuit
 Call stripe.split_payment buyer amount seller 90%
 DO Audit and immutable

ON purchase.complete
DO Email and Call email.send template = "shipped"

WHEN daily DO Payout and bulk
 FOR each Seller DO Call stripe.payout
